{"title":"2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Grace places a pencil in a cylindrical cup and is surprised to see that it fits diagonally. The pencil is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> units long and of negligible thickness. The cup is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units tall. The volume of the cup can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7b6b9d217194b2a79485901cdf525545aa5898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> cubic units. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Sprint14.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/e/e2/Sprint14.jpg/200px-Sprint14.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"217\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/e/e2/Sprint14.jpg/300px-Sprint14.jpg 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/e/e2/Sprint14.jpg/400px-Sprint14.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, we have that the diameter of the cylinder's base is 15 units long. Thus, the cylinder's base has radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/a/92abfb6ac4e4fdd3aa59c479be5affaea325d5b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> units. Thus, the volume of the cylinder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/5/d0533e320547ade2100a02079f60536e910edc6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{15}{2}\\right)^2\\cdot8\\pi=\\boxed{450}\\pi.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"170\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~Lamboreghini\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The diameter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/5403ac5c013c1c9e3f5820dc1759e292d1e7e919.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\pi \\left(\\frac{15}{2}\\right)^2 \\cdot 8=450 \\pi\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"46\" /> So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32aab1f4f842bc0b67b3ce9362b5b2b4220746b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=\\boxed{450}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"75\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>- kante314 -\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Sprint Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Sprint Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018020044\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 183/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1649/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.466      1 Template:JMPSC_Notice\n100.00%    5.466      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21613:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018020044 and revision id 158222. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}